s.  There are 1000s of parking spots at the Redondo Beach Pier with up to 24 hour metered parking.\n\n\n**Top 5 reasons to rent an e-bike from the Redondo Beach Pier:**\n- You can easily hop around from one place to the next without worrying about parking.\n- Take in the sun and outdoors without the sweaty grind of pedaling a traditional pedal-power bike.\n- Feel like a kid again with the thrill of riding an electric bike.\n- Exercise when you want or use the ample power (pedal assist or throttle) to just cruise.\n- Convenient beach access without struggling to find a parking spot.\n\n**E-Bike Rental Includes:**\n- Single rider e-bike with step-through frame and front basket\n- Lock and helmet\n- 12 Amp Hour Battery, up to 50 mile range\n- 5 level pedal assist\n- Comfortable cushioned seat\n- E-Bike Orientation:  We provide a complete tutorial on the e-bike so you'll know how to use all of the features and feel comfortable riding. Riders must adhere to the safety guidelines agreed to in the rental agreement.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "7-Day E-Bike Rental", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/items/479103/images/1022314/", "pk": 1022314, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/PTfS7XYLRNOdOoUUaoHx", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/PTfS7XYLRNOdOoUUaoHx", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/items/479103/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 366, "width": 2545, "height": 1339, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ew3F18DnQiiuN8JDPJqQ"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ew3F18DnQiiuN8JDPJqQ", "cropped_cdn_url": "https